    {
      "text": "Self-assessment of the review's own cost-effectiveness analysis of novel skin tests for diagnosing TB infection against the Drummond checklist. Rows are the checklist questions, grouped under ten main criteria; the single column gives the answer and comments for this study.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
